    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="Rubriken">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IVAtr">IV Atr</ref> Rubriken</head>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="la" source="#liebermann" n="Rubriken" corresp="#wit-q"><pb n="232" ed="#liebermann"/>XX. De institutis Lundonie; et primum: que porte obseruabantur. XXI [2]. De teloneo dando ad Bilingesgate. XXII [3]. De teloneo retento. XXIII [4]. De hamsocna uel in porto uel in uia regia. XXIIII [5]. De falsariis et eis consentientibus. Et de cum falsa moneta deprensis. XXVII [6]. De sonantibus pecuniam puram. XXVIII [7]. De mercatoribus qui falsum et lactum afferunt ad portum. XXIX [8]. De suasione regis contra falsum operantes. [9 Et de monetariis.]</ab>
        <ab type="editionText" xml:lang="la" source="#robertson" corresp="#wit-q"><ptr type="editorNote" n="2" target="#IVAtr_part-001.robnote.fn.2"/><pb n="70" ed="#robertson"/>[De institutis Lundoniae; et primum: quae<ptr type="editorNote" n="3" target="#IVAtr_part-001.robnote.fn.3"/> portae observabantur<ptr type="editorNote" n="4" target="#IVAtr_part-001.robnote.fn.4"/>. [2.] De teloneo dando ad Bilingesgate. [3.] De teloneo retento. [4.] De hamsocna vel in porto<ptr type="editorNote" n="5" target="#IVAtr_part-001.robnote.fn.5"/> vel in via regia<ptr type="editorNote" n="6" target="#IVAtr_part-001.robnote.fn.6"/>. [5.] De falsariis et eis consentientibus. Et de cum falsa moneta deprensis<ptr type="editorNote" n="7" target="#IVAtr_part-001.robnote.fn.7"/>. [6.] Et de monetariis<ptr type="editorNote" n="8" target="#IVAtr_part-001.robnote.fn.8"/>.]</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#robertson" corresp="#wit-q"><pb n="71" ed="#robertson"/>[Concerning the decrees of London; and first: what gates were manned. [2] Concerning the paying of tax at Billingsgate. [3] Concerning withheld tax [4] Concerning breaking and entering either in the harbour or on the king's highway. [5] Concerning false coiners and those who assist them. And about issuing false currency. [6] And concerning the coinage.]</ab>
        <note type="editorial">Rubric list from MHkBr (Liebermann's footnote on p. 232), drawn only from the Latin text of the latest Quadripartitus edition; bracketed chapter numbers are Liebermann's. No German translation.</note>
        <note type="editorNote" subtype="footnote" xml:id="IVAtr_part-001.robnote.fn.2" n="2" source="#robertson"><bibl><biblScope unit="page">70</biblScope></bibl><label>De</label><seg type="original" xml:lang="en">This table of contents is found in M, Hk, Br.</seg></note>
        <note type="editorNote" subtype="footnote" xml:id="IVAtr_part-001.robnote.fn.3" n="3" source="#robertson"><bibl><biblScope unit="page">70</biblScope></bibl><label>quae</label><seg type="original" xml:lang="en"><hi rend="italic">quod</hi> Br.</seg></note>
        <note type="editorNote" subtype="footnote" xml:id="IVAtr_part-001.robnote.fn.4" n="4" source="#robertson"><bibl><biblScope unit="page">70</biblScope></bibl><label>observabantur</label><seg type="original" xml:lang="en"><hi rend="italic">-buntur</hi> Br.</seg></note>
        <note type="editorNote" subtype="footnote" xml:id="IVAtr_part-001.robnote.fn.5" n="5" source="#robertson"><bibl><biblScope unit="page">70</biblScope></bibl><label>porto</label><seg type="original" xml:lang="en"><hi rend="italic">-tu</hi> Br.</seg></note>
        <note type="editorNote" subtype="footnote" xml:id="IVAtr_part-001.robnote.fn.6" n="6" source="#robertson"><bibl><biblScope unit="page">70</biblScope></bibl><label>regia</label><seg type="original" xml:lang="en"><hi rend="italic">-gis</hi> Br.</seg></note>
        <note type="editorNote" subtype="footnote" xml:id="IVAtr_part-001.robnote.fn.7" n="7" source="#robertson"><bibl><biblScope unit="page">70</biblScope></bibl><label>deprensis</label><seg type="original" xml:lang="en">Instead of <hi rend="italic">Et…depr.</hi> Br has: [6.] <hi rend="italic">De sonantibus pecuniam puram.</hi> [7.] <hi rend="italic">De mercatoribus qui falsum et lactum afferunt ad portum.</hi> [8.] <hi rend="italic">De suasione regis contra falsum operantes.</hi></seg></note>
        <note type="editorNote" subtype="footnote" xml:id="IVAtr_part-001.robnote.fn.8" n="8" source="#robertson"><bibl><biblScope unit="page">70</biblScope></bibl><label>monetariis</label><seg type="original" xml:lang="en">[9]…<hi rend="italic">m. et ubi erunt</hi> Br.</seg></note>
      </div>
    </body>
